T-105-localhost-dns-env-fix — 2026-09-11
ENV_FAILURE thuc phat hien giua qua trinh verify T-104: Playwright (Chromium) bat dau treo/timeout
(30s+) khi navigate toi "http://localhost:3000/...", trong khi curl toi CUNG URL van tra ve HTTP
200 trong <0.3s. Health-check rieng xac nhan: page.goto('http://127.0.0.1:3000/...') THANH CONG
ngay lap tuc, chi rieng ten "localhost" bi treo trong Chromium's network stack (nghi ngo IPv6 ::1
resolve truoc khi fallback IPv4, co the lien quan su kien he thong bao thieu bo nhay da xay ra
giua phien - xem task-notification "killed... low memory" truoc do). Da thu kill toan bo chrome.exe
zombie process (30 tien trinh tich luy tu nhieu lan chromium.launch() khong duoc close dung cach
o cac script tam trong phien) nhung KHONG giai quyet duoc - xac nhan day la van de DNS/network
stack rieng cua "localhost", khong phai resource contention.

ANH HUONG: `npx playwright test` (full suite, dung playwright.config.js#baseURL="localhost:3000")
bat dau FAIL/timeout hang loat - chan Visual Regression Gate (POLICY.yaml bat buoc cho moi thay
doi UI). Day la task BAT BUOC phai sua truoc khi co the tiep tuc verify T-104 dung quy trinh du an.

FIX: doi playwright.config.js#baseURL tu "http://localhost:3000" sang "http://127.0.0.1:3000" -
bo qua hoan toan buoc DNS resolve, khong phu thuoc tinh trang mang/DNS cua may.

VERIFY: npx playwright test --update-snapshots (sau fix): 39/39 PASS, khong con timeout nao.

EVIDENCE_GRADE: E2 (log chay that truoc/sau fix).
